  "description": "The ideal hardtail mountain bike for fast singletrack routes, flowing trail sessions and long days in the saddle, the Marley 1.0 Hardtail Bike is strong, agile and fun. It features a robust and lightweight alloy frame that's equipped with 130mm travel Marzocchi Bomber Z2 suspension forks, and Shimano Deore 11-Speed groupset that includes a wide-ranging 11-51 Tooth cassette and hydraulic disc brakes. Plus, it rolls upon Nukeproof Neutron hubs laced into Tubeless Ready WTB STi30 rims that are wrapped in Maxxis Minion DHF and DHRII MaxxTerra tyres.\nLightweight, Playful and Versatile Hardtail Bike\nThe Marley has become a classic: light, punchy and versatile. It might be your first bike to explore off-road, or the agile plaything of a seasoned rider. Using 6061 alloy tubing, the Marley balances a stiff frame with enough compliance for the longest of days in the saddle.\nShimano Deore 11-Speed Groupset and Hydraulic Disc Brakes\nThe Marley 1.0 takes all that’s great about the 2.0 but supercharges the spec: The addition of the group test winning Brand-X Ascend dropper. An upgraded 11-speed Deore groupset and M6100 brakes. Keeping things lively at the business end; a Marzocchi Bomber Z2 Rail fork provides additional stiffness with 130mm of exceptional damping.\nEverything you could want from an all-round hardtail; get wild straight out of the box.",
